# tracer runs a hand-assembled stand-in program (machine_standin.c) on the profile-driven bus,
# entered through the profile's reset vector, and sees its RAM writes and its machine time; the
# other cases check reset with EXEC and GROM only, power-cycle equivalence with one reset of the
