# Family iso (plan 03-12, D-36, API-01): two instances with different content (stand-ins A and B)
# step without affecting each other: interleaved equals sequential at every 8th unit, differently
# poisoned storage ends byte-identical, a memcpy-relocated instance continues identically,
# destroying one mid-run leaves the other on its solo trace, loads into one leave the other's
# digest and bytes unchanged. No threads.
